sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as Dashboard<br/>«view»
    participant SI as StatusIndicator<br/>«component»
    participant BC as BrandController<br/>«controller»
    participant BS as BrandService<br/>«service»
    participant RR as ReportRepository<br/>«repository»

    U->>FE: open /dashboard, select a brand
    FE->>SI: mount with source={brand, brandId}
    SI->>BC: GET /api/brands/{brandId}/status-indicator
    BC->>BS: getBrandStatusIndicator(brandId)
    BS->>RR: aggregate latest completed reports for brand (companyId scope)
    RR-->>BS: avg score, sentiment buckets, top emotions, top aspects
    BS-->>BC: BrandStatusIndicatorResponse
    BC-->>SI: 200 OK
    SI-->>U: score dial + dominant emotion + top aspects

    Note over BC,RR: Endpoint also exists at /api/reports/{reportId}/status-indicator<br/>(report-scoped variant) — not currently mounted in any page.
